($q$Brew coffee concentrate$q$, 3, $q$Bottle and keep in the fridge.$q$, NULL),
($q$Brown butter-washed bourbon$q$, 0, $q$Melt the butter in a pan over medium heat and cook, swirling, until the milk solids turn golden brown and it smells nutty. Take off the heat at once.$q$, NULL),
