($q$Strawberry-infused Campari$q$, $q$recipe$q$, $q$https://www.starchefs.com/recipes/very-strong-baby$q$, $q$reference$q$, DATE '2026-10-13', $q$StarChefs: 16 oz (454 g) halved strawberries to 1 litre Campari, at least 24 hours. Scaled to 700 ml that is 318 g; our 350 g is within 10%.$q$),
($q$Super lemon juice$q$, $q$recipe$q$, $q$https://hildaskitchenblog.com/recipe/how-to-make-super-juice$q$, $q$reference$q$, DATE '2026-10-13', $q$For lemon, citric acid equal to the peel weight and no malic; water at 16.66 x peel weight; juice of the peeled fruit added unmeasured.$q$),
