($q$Tea-infused vermouth$q$, $q$keeps$q$, $q$https://vinepair.com/articles/should-amaro-or-vermouth-be-refrigerated$q$, $q$reference$q$, DATE '2026-10-13', $q$Keep belongs to plain opened vermouth, refrigerated. Steeping tea adds no sugar or alcohol, so the infused vermouth is no more preserved than plain.$q$),
