($q$Tom and Jerry batter$q$, $q$recipe$q$, $q$https://imbibemagazine.com/recipe/tom-jerry-batter/$q$, $q$reference$q$, DATE '2026-10-13', $q$12 eggs, 1 oz Jamaican rum, 1 1/2 tsp each ground cloves and allspice, 1 tsp cinnamon, 1/4 tsp ground anise, 2 lb cane sugar; yolks and rum folded into stiff whites, then sugar. 2 lb at 450 g per lb.$q$),
